{"words": [{"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "يَسْتَهْزِئُ", "translation": "mocks"}, {"text": "بِهِمْ", "translation": "at them"}, {"text": "وَيَمُدُّهُمْ", "translation": "and prolongs them"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "طُغْيَـٰنِهِمْ", "translation": "their transgression"}, {"text": "يَعْمَهُونَ", "translation": "they wander blindly"}], "sahih": "[But] Allāh mocks them and prolongs them in their transgression [while] they wander blindly."}